Mozilla CA bundle (cacert.pem)

Source: the dated file from https://curl.se/ca/ published by the curl project,
which extracts the trusted certificates from the Mozilla trust store. The exact
file name and SHA-256 are pinned in third_party/versions.json. The bundle is
copied to assets/cacert.pem and shipped inside this plugin.

